    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Saga of the Great Wolf",
    "summary": "Friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES units that have this ability, other than MONSTER or VEHICLE units, gain three abilities. Encircling Jaws: while such a unit has the assault doctrine active, it adds 1 to its charge rolls and its advance rolls. Hunter’s Eye: while it has the devastator doctrine active, its ranged attacks may re-roll a hit roll of 1. Ferocious Strike: while it has the tactical doctrine active, its attacks have [SUSTAINED HITS 1] when they target an enemy unit that is 'with 9\"' of it. LOGAN GRIMNAR units of yours gain Howling Onslaught: your army may use it just once per battle, in your Command phase, and then ADEPTUS ASTARTES MONSTER or VEHICLE units of yours also benefit from Master of Wolves until your next Command phase starts. Restrictions: SPACE WOLVES units are allowed in your army, but ADEPTUS ASTARTES units from any other Chapter are not. The 9\" distance in Ferocious Strike is given as 'with 9\"' rather than 'within 9\"', so which enemy units it covers is left open.",
